Package: baobab
Version: @DEB_BAOBAB_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Applications
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.gnome.org/DiskUsageAnalyzer/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0
Description: GNOME Disk Usage Analyzer (Baobab, GTK4)
 Baobab scans folders and whole filesystems and shows where space goes as a
 ring chart and treemap, so large directories are easy to find. GTK4/libadwaita,
 written in Vala. Runs as a plain X11 client under any window manager.
